...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down
grid-columns: 3

user: 사용자 { class: person }
app: Streamlit 앱 (레슨별 app.py) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

seq_shell: SequentialAgent (business_intelligence_team) { class: ours }
loop_shell: LoopAgent (spec_refinement_loop) { class: ours }
par_shell: ParallelAgent (market_snapshot_team) { class: ours }

seq_children: 9_1: LlmAgent 4개, for문 순서대로 { class: ours }
loop_children: 9_2: LlmAgent 1 + BaseAgent 2, while문 반복 { class: ours }
par_children: 9_3: LlmAgent 3개, 브랜치로 동시 실행 { class: ours }

user -> app: 주제 입력
app -> seq_shell: run_async (9_1)
app -> loop_shell: run_async (9_2)
app -> par_shell: run_async (9_3)
seq_shell -> seq_children: 한 번에 하나씩
loop_shell -> loop_children: 매 반복마다
par_shell -> par_children: 동시에
seq_children -> gemini: 모델 호출
loop_children -> gemini: 모델 호출
par_children -> gemini: 모델 호출
